\u00f6rderhand<br>\nfiel am 31. M\u00e4rz 1922 die<br>\nFamilie Gabriel-Gruber<br>\nvon hier zum Opfer<br>\nAndreas Gruber geb. 1857<br>\nCezilia Gruber geb. 1849<br>\nViktoria Gabriel geb. 1887<br>\ngeb. Gruber / deren Kinder<br>\nCezilia geb. 1915<br>\nJosef geb. 1919<br>\nMaria Baumgartner <br>\nDienstmagd geb. 1877\n</p>\n</div>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"DateTimeOriginal":{"value":"2007-01-16 17:25","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Credit":{"value":"<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.flickr.com/photos/35659542@N04/4195370468/\">Hinterkaifeck 2</a>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Artist":{"value":"<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.flickr.com/people/35659542@N04\">Christian Greller</a> from Regenstauf, Germany","source":"commons-desc-page"},"LicenseShortName":{"value":"CC BY 2.0","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"UsageTerms":{"value":"Creative Commons Attribution 2.0","source":"commons-desc-page"},"AttributionRequired":{"value":"true","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"LicenseUrl":{"value":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/2.0","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Copyrighted":{"value":"True","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"Restrictions":{"value":"","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"License":{"value":"cc-by-2.0","source":"commons-templates","hidden":""}}}]},"125999606":{"pageid":125999606,"ns":6,"title":"File:Photo - Hinterkaifeck.jpg","imagerepository":"local","imageinfo":[{"size":384711,"width":960,"height":430,"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/80/Photo_-_Hinterkaifeck.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","descriptionurl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Photo_-_Hinterkaifeck.jpg","descriptionshorturl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?curid=125999606","extmetadata":{"DateTime":{"value":"2022-11-27 09:27:52","source":"mediawiki-metadata","hidden":""},"ObjectName":{"value":"Photo - Hinterkaifeck","source":"mediawiki-metadata"},"CommonsMetadataExtension":{"value":1.2,"source":"extension","hidden":""},"Categories":{"value":"Hinterkaifeck|Farmhouses in Bavaria|History of Landkreis Neuburg-Schrobenhausen|PD-anon-expired|Template Unknown (author)","source":"commons-categories","hidden":""},"Assessments":{"value":"","source":"commons-categories","hidden":""},"ImageDescription":{"value":"Photo - Ein\u00f6dhof Hinterkaifeck - before 1922.<br>\n<ul><li>Depiction of the Hinterkaifeck wasteland, labelled <i><b>Hint.-Kaifeck</b></i> in the (official topographic) <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://v.bayern.de/ZNbf9\">position sheet 1:25,000, sheet number 552, year of publication <b>1912</b> on BayernAtlas</a>. The depiction of individual buildings including the place name <i><b>Hint.-Kaifeck</b></i> was retained in the (partially) continued editions of sheet no. 552 from <b>1940</b> and <b>1953</b>. It was not until <b>1959</b>, the year in which the 1:25,000 <i>Schrobenhausen 7433</i> topographic map was published, that the Bavarian State Surveying Office changed the cartographic designation. Landesvermessungsamt added the cartographic symbol <i>\"Gedenkkreuz, Wegkreuz, Bildstock (Marterl)\"</i> at the site of the farm building demolished around 1923. This representation remained on the above map until the year of publication <b>2007</b>, see official topographic map 1:25,000 <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://v.bayern.de/P8348\">Schrobenhausen 7433, year of publication 1995, valid until 2006</a>. In the current map editions, a memorial cross (Marterl) is entered, which was erected approx. 260 metres further southwest on a local road leading off to the east and south, this road leads directly to the <a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://de.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kaifeck_(Waidhofen)\"><i>Kaifeck wasteland in the municipality of Waidhofen</i></a>. Translated with DeepL.com (free version). <br></li>\n<li>Note: German: <i>Gedenkkreuz, Wegkreuz, Bildstock (bayerisch: Marterl)</i> =&gt; English: <i>Memorial cross, wayside cross, wayside shrine (Bavarian: Marterl)</i>.</li></ul>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"DateTimeOriginal":{"value":"-","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Credit":{"value":"<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://media1.faz.net/ppmedia/aktuell/gesellschaft/1213863348/1.7921447/format_top1_breit/erst-vor-einigen-jahren.jpg\">https://media1.faz.net/ppmedia/aktuell/gesellschaft/1213863348/1.7921447/format_top1_breit/erst-vor-einigen-jahren.jpg</a>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Artist":{"value":"Unknown author<span style=\"display: none;\">Unknown author</span>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"LicenseShortName":{"value":"Public domain","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"UsageTerms":{"value":"Public domain","source":"commons-desc-page"},"AttributionRequired":{"value":"false","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"Copyrighted":{"value":"False","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"Restrictions":{"value":"","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"License":{"value":"pd","source":"commons-templates","hidden":""}}}]}}}}